                  "timeZone" : "America/New_York"
               },
               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Possibly define a format for the data (or use existing tools that parse/gen from olsen DB) - and define predefined timezones. NOT CLEAR what fields these would have.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "One use case is simply fixed offset - so +500, or -430, etc. So maybe have an Optional<uint16_t> fSecondsOffset; ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "And another Timezone could be something that MAY have notion of localtime.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "THen - add method to Timezone - Apply (DateTime to) -> DateTime - and have it look at the date if needed (to apply localtime rules) and ignore it if no such localtime rules (say cuz fixed offset).",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
                  ],
                  "type" : "doc",
                  "version" : 1
               },
